### Test 1: Get Catalog - All vehicles
POST {{baseUrl}}/Vehicle/getCatalog
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Test 2: Get Catalog - By license plate with components
POST {{baseUrl}}/Vehicle/getCatalog
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "licensePlate": "C123ABC",
  "includeComponents": true
}

### Test 3: Get Catalog - Unassigned vehicles of a division
POST {{baseUrl}}/Vehicle/getCatalog
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "divisionId": 210,
  "assignedToUnit": false
}

### Test 4: Get Catalog - Invalid (organization not accessible)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Vehicle/getCatalog
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationId": 999999
}
